!.env.example
# Firebase's web config isn't a secret (see FIREBASE_SETUP.md) — committing
# it is how the GitHub Pages build (`vite build --mode gh-pages`) picks it
# up, since there's no server to inject it at runtime. .env.local (git-
# ignored, machine-specific) always overrides this for local dev.
!.env.gh-pages
